			}
			te_sr_settler_rows = {}
		}
	}

	### One colony we hold in Colony Autonomy (simple and full colonies; slice 5
	### design § 9): its icon and name, its autonomy (0-100) and its drift a month
	### (the drift's terms on hover), its status (Charter, Garrison or both), and
	### Abandon (sr_colony_abandon_sgui, scope:site = the world's index), which asks
	### first (space_race_events.93). 24 + 180 + 40 + 44 + 72 + 66 + 5 × 4 spacing
	### + 2 × 4 margin = 454, in the 480 column. Instances in te_sr_autonomy_rows
	### (sr_sites_generated_rows.gui).
